   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{E4A9394634BDF2AF}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "I. Situation:"
     m_sContent "<h2>I. Situation:</h2>"\
     "<b>Time & Weather:</b>"\
     "Time - Attackers Choose"\
     "Weather - Defenders Choose"\
     ""\
     "<b>Situation:</b>"\
     "Russian VDV have managed to successfully air assault onto the Bysovice Airfield (HAH), securing the military base, industrial area and more. A VDV Company with strengthened platoons and an attached BRDM platoon is now making their way to secure Kamoryn from a Canadian Rifle Platoon located there, while the Canadians are preparing to maintain their control over the town."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{963B42C464C103E9}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "Canadians are equipped with their standard NATO weaponry. etc"\
     "Wearing woodland coloured camo uniforms & helmets."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x Canadian Rifle Platoon"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "Royal Marines located in Kamoryn"\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to M16A1s series, LAWs/M67s, M60, M249, Carl Gustavs, etc."\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Engage us before we establish a solid foothold in their town before pulling back"\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Prepare killzones to decimate a platoon before pulling back into harder defences."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known in-direct threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "No known Air support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "Very High."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat as of now."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0F834727F2DB2021}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>A. Enemy Forces:</h2>"\
     "<b>Equipment:</b>"\
     "Russians are equipped with their standard WARSAW Pact weaponry, AK series, RPG7s, PRKs."\
     "Wearing the standard NVA uniform of Dark green with greenish helmet."\
     ""\
     "<b>Known Strength:</b>"\
     "1x Company (-)"\
     "1x BRDM Platoon"\
     ""\
     "<b>Location:</b>"\
     "Company & BRDMs are located West of the town."\
     ""\
     "<b>Capabilities:</b>"\
     "Access to RPGs, RPKs"\
     "Vehicles include BRDMs"\
     ""\
     "<b>MLCOA:</b>"\
     "Locate a good attack vector before shoving their whole company through it"\
     ""\
     "<b>MDCOA:</b>"\
     "Locate a easy attack vector, utilize their BRDMs to push us off the towns and buildings before shoving their company through."\
     ""\
     "<b>Defensive Fires:</b>"\
     "No known in-direct threat at this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>Airthreat:</b>"\
     "No known Air support."\
     ""\
     "<b>Morale:</b>"\
     "Alright."\
     ""\
     "<b>CBRN Threat:</b>"\
     "The enemy pose no CBRN Threat as of now."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ABFC80699C5C36E8}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "Russian VDV Company is located West of Kamoryn"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "Company has been tasked with securing the town of Kamoryn after successfully securing the airfield."\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x Company HQ"\
     "2x Platoon (+)"\
     "1x BRDM Platoon"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "Company HQ - At 3x Soldiers Strong"\
     "1st VDV Platoon - At 27x Soldiers Strong"\
     "2nd VDV Platoon - At 27x Soldiers Strong"\
     "BRDM Platoon - At 9x Soldiers Strong"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None as of this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "No air support available"\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
     "Additional Ammunition in the BRDMs"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D5AAFB52622BDEB8}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "B. Friendly Forces:"
     m_sContent "<h2>B. Friendly Forces</h2>"\
     "<b>a. Disposition:</b>"\
     "Canadian Rifle Platoon is located at the town of Kamoryn"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Higher Units Mission:</b>"\
     "We've been tasked with maintaining control over Kamoryn after the Russians secured the Airfield"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Composition:</b>"\
     "1x Canadian Rifle Platoon"\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Strength:</b>"\
     "1st Plt - At 28x Man Strength"\
     ""\
     "<b>e. Supporting Fires:</b>"\
     "None as of this time."\
     ""\
     "<b>f. Attachments/Detachments:</b>"\
     "No air support available"\
     ""\
     "<b>g. Additional Ammunition</b>"\
