    GC_Briefing "{F1C338D5020984F9}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Secure the 3x buildings within the town and kill 90% of the Canadian forces located there."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{82FC2B18C2F68709}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Mission (Must Read):"
     m_sContent "<h2>II: Mission</h2>"\
     "Maintain control over the town of Kamoryn"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{3CA165DE84098AE2}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Secure the town of Kamoryn"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to utilize the BRDMs to either locate the enemy or suppress them in windows & buildings, to allow the Platoons to move up and start clearing them."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to not spread the Platoons far from each other so they can mutually support one another."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0FE1CAE344ABEAA7}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "III. Execution:"
     m_sContent "<h2>III: Execution</h2>"\
     "<b>Intent:</b>"\
     "Maintain control over Kamoryn"\
     ""\
     "<b>1. Concept of the Operation:</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised for the Platoon to setup killzones on likely attack routes, prepare AT to kill BRDMs and prepare fallback positions."\
     ""\
     "<b>2. Maneuver</b>"\
     "Company Commander's Discretion."\
     "It is advised to NOT split up the sections too far so they can mutually support one another or be able to quickly support as needed."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{4876D77B19B6AF7A}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Russian Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Russian Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
     "Replen Plan: None for 24h."\
     "Ammunition: Each man carries his own ammunition."\
     "IPE: Helmets and body armour are to be worn at all times."\
     ""\
     "BTRs & Urals contains:"\
     "- 4x Bandages"\
     "- 4x Tourniquets"\
     "- 4x Morphines"\
     "- 80x AK Mags"\
     "- 4x Grenades"\
     "- 10x Smoke Grenades"\
     "- 40x TSh-400g Explosives"\
     "- 10x KPM 3U1 Blasting Machine"\
     "- 50x Handheld White Flares"\
     "- 50x Handheld Orange Flares"\
     "- 50x Handheld Green Flares"\
     ""\
     "<b>c. Medical:</b>"\
     "Location: Platoon Aid Post is to be setup by Platoon medics."\
     "CASEVAC: By foot or with company asset like the BTRs if there are any."\
     "Plan: Set up a casualty collection point and extract casualties to this point."\
     "Stretchers: None"\
     "Med Packs: Platoon medpack carried by Platoon medic."\
     "Morphine: Every soldier carries 1+ stick of morphine."\
     ""\
     "<b>d. Vehicles:</b>"\
     "3x BRDMs"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_AFRF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{97BF7391A7DBB1B0}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "IV. Sustainment:"
     m_sContent "<h2>IV: Sustainment</h2>"\
     "<b>a. SOP Variations</b>"\
     "Dress: Standard Canadian Uniform"\
     "Equipment: Standard Canadian Loadout"\
     ""\
     "<b>b. Logistical Support:</b>"\
